      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gochiti mirgaa baate",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka worri Israeli deebiu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, Yo guyyaani sunini gahu, worri Israelitiifi ka Yuda bohaa d'ufe, ana Waaqa isaani barbaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri kara Sioni gaafate achi yaa. Duuba worri wold'aqisa jiru jireenna ka na woliini tolfate kaani, deebie inch'absu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gumiini tiyya hooliye tissituuni kara iraa gorsite gaara irati balleesite fakaati. Worri gaareeni ch'ufa ira yayae, worra ufi gara wollaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami worra argu ch'ufti worra had'a. Nyaapi isaani waan jed'u, Worri kunini AABBO Waaqati ch'ubbame, tanaafi wonti nu worra tolchine hamtuniti. Ababooti worraa AABBO Waaqa abdate, worrileeni sila AABBO Waaqa iraa goru himmalle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mul 18.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worra Israeli, lafa Babiloni keesaa baqad'a. Lafa worraa keesaa baha, nama qara ka lafa suni keesa bahu taha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini gosa jajabdu mirgaa jirtu kaase, Babiloni haasisa. Worri had'iisaa ejaanje, lafa had'e dabsata. Worri sunini guddo t'iyaani woi had'u beekha, yo darbatu woma ind'abu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babiloni insaamani, nami saamuleeni waan jed'u ch'ufa guurata. Nami dubbi tana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Babiloni balleesani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, Worra Babiloni, isani gosa tiyya saamtani, tanaafi gammadani qilit'amtani, akuma looni mid'aani biilatini d'aanani yokhaani akuma farda imimsu yaatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo dira keesani gudda kana balleesani ch'eersani. Babilonini gadii lafa ch'ufa taati, isiini lafa gamooji ta bisaani inqamne taati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maro dallansu tiyyatifi nami tokoleeni Babiloni keesa intau; isii ona tolchani, nami d'aatu dabru ch'ufti rifate maadefata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "T'iyole ch'orora ejaanja, had'iisa Babiloniti kurfefad'a, dira marsa. Waan Babilonini ana AABBO Waaqati ch'ubbamteefi t'iya teesani ch'ufaani had'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gama ch'ufaa iti iyya! Babilonini amma ya harka kennate. Naabo isa ya ch'absani balleesani. Anini worra Babiloni haalo baafachuu jira, tanaafi isanileeni haalo baafad'a, akuma worri nama d'ibi tolche, worrale tolcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafa suni keesati mid'aani fach'aasanifi ka muratanile d'owa. Nami gosa d'ibi ka achi keesa tauleeni nyaapa dira suni had'u sodaate lafa ufiti gala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka worri Israeli deebiu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, Worri Israeli hooliye nyeench'i had'e gargari firfirse fakaata. Qara hayyu Ashuruti worra had'e, eege hayyu Babiloni ka Nebukadreza jed'aniti lafele worraa annifata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi anini, AABBO Waaqi guddaani Waaqi Israeli, Nebukadrezafi lafa isale gaargalcha, akuma anini qara hayyu Ashuru gaaragalche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini worra Israeli lafa isaniti deebisa. Worri sagale gaara Karmeli irati baatefi ta lafa Bashani keesati baatele nyaate. Ammalle mid'aani lafa Efraimutifi ta Gileadi keesati bahale haga fed'u nyaata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hojja guyyaani sunini gahu, Israeli keesati ch'ubbu tokole inargani, Yuda keesale hameenni injiru; wonti akanatiifi anini worra hambise kana ch'ubbu isani inaraaramafi, nami dubbi tana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gaargala Waaqi Babilonitini d'ufu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u worra Merathaimutifi worra Pekodi had'a, fit'a, hobaasa. Waan anini isaniini jed'u ch'ufa tolcha. Nami dubbi tana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyyanna lolaatifi balleesa nama balleesani lafa keesati d'agayani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babilonini qara lafa ch'ufa burrisaani tumte, ammo amma tana burrisa suni ya ch'absani! Waan lafa suni tolchani arginaani gochiti ch'ufti iraa rifate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babiloni, atini na haate, ammo amma ya t'urura anini si kaye ato imbeekhini keesa seente. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini fulla miha kiyya ka lola iti olkayani bane, dallansu tiyya keesa alati baase; wonti akanatiifi anini, AABBO Waaqi guddaani Babiloni keesa huji qaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moga ch'ufaa had'a fulla mid'aani isii iti olkayani ch'ufa ch'absa bana! Waan saamtani aka mid'aani wolti tuula! Lafa balleesa! Woma inhambisina! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Askarti worraa ch'ufa qaqala, hobaasa! Worra Babiloni ya badiini qabatte! guyyaani worra gaargalchani ya gahe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Nami Babiloni keesaa baqate Yerusalemu d'ufe waan jed'u, AABBO Waaqi keenna ya worra Babiloni haalo baafate, waan worri nama Waaqa qulqullo balleesefi.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
